---
// src/pages/how-it-works.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How It Works — The Spec-First Process | Web Harbor Solutions"
  description="See our 3-step zero-risk process: we build your site for free, you review it live, and we launch it on your domain in 5–7 days."
  canonical="https://webharborsolutions.com/how-it-works/"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24 md:pb-16 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="hero-badge inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-teal/10 text-accent-teal border border-accent-teal/20 mb-6 backdrop-blur-md">
        <span>The Spec-First Process</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display tracking-tight mb-6">
        The 3-Step Path to a Better Website.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        No sales pitch meetings that could have been emails. No 40-page creative briefs. Just fast, clean, risk-free execution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 Steps Stepper (With 3D Tilt Cards) -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div
          data-tilt
          class="step-card flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-card backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-blue to-blue-600 text-white font-extrabold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
            01
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-blue dark:text-blue-400">Day 1 – 2 (48 Hours)</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-400">$0 Cost</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-4 font-display">The Zero-Dollar Spec Prototype</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We locate your business data, Google Maps reviews, hours, and photos from public listings. Our engineering team hand-codes a custom, mobile-responsive prototype on our test edge network.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We email or WhatsApp you a private preview link. You test it on your own phone with your morning coffee. You have spent zero dollars with zero obligation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div
          data-tilt
          class="step-card flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-card backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-teal to-teal-600 text-white font-extrabold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
            02
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-teal dark:text-teal-400">Day 3 – 4</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 dark:bg-blue-950/60 dark:text-blue-400">Unlimited Adjustments</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-4 font-display">Review &amp; Custom Revisions</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              You review the live prototype on real devices. You tell us what you love and what you want changed—color adjustments, text updates, team photos, or specific service specials.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Our team refines the build until you are 100% satisfied. If you aren't thrilled with what we built, you simply walk away.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div
          data-tilt
          class="step-card flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-card backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300"
        >
          <div class="shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-600 to-emerald-700 text-white font-extrabold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
            03
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Day 5 – 7</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-400">Go-Live &amp; Handoff</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-4 font-display">Domain Deployment &amp; Onboarding</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Once you approve the design, you pay the first 50% ($50) of the one-time $100 setup fee. We purchase and configure your custom domain name and launch the site across Cloudflare's ultra-fast global edge network.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Once you verify the site is live and secure on your domain, you settle the final $50 setup balance. Your $99/month ongoing hosting, domain management, SSL, and maintenance retainer commences.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Need From You Checklist -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white/50 dark:bg-slate-950/40 border-y border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-md relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-accent-blue dark:text-blue-400 mb-3">Minimal Effort For You</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-50 font-display">What We Need From You</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3">We respect your time. Our onboarding process requires less than 15 minutes total.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div data-tilt class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-accent-blue dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4 shadow-xs">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Verified Hours &amp; Phone</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Your correct business phone, dispatch area, emergency line, and operational schedule.</p>
        </div>

        <div data-tilt class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-100 dark:bg-teal-950/60 text-accent-teal dark:text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4 shadow-xs">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Photos (If Available)</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">High-res photos of your fleet, team, or completed jobs. (If you don't have them, we use clean typography and curated assets).</p>
        </div>

        <div data-tilt class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4 shadow-xs">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-dark dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Core Services List</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">The high-margin services you actually want calls for, so we structure your conversion funnel around them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-primary-dark text-white relative z-10 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-display mb-4">Let Us Build Your Demo This Week</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
        No payment, no contract, no credit card. Just tell us your business name and watch what we build.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-semibold text-white bg-accent-blue hover:bg-accent-blue-hover shadow-lg transition duration-200"
      >
        Request Your Free Demo Now
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
